WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Wannan bidiyon yana bayanin yadda ake amfani da Arclight don aiwatar da jajayen reflex ta hanyar zaɓar saitin haske mafi haske.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Tabbatar cewa tarin ruwan tabarau yana saman, inda babu ikon ruwan tabarau a cikin rami na gani.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
A tsayin hannu, lura da reflex a idanu biyu a lokaci guda.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Kwatanta haske da launi tsakanin idanu biyu.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
A cikin gwajin al'ada, bai kamata a sami bambanci gaba ɗaya a cikin haske da launi tsakanin idanu biyu ba.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
A cikin fararen fata da jarirai na Asiya, reflex na iya yin kama da orange da rawaya.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Har yanzu waɗannan bayyanuwa duk na al'ada ne saboda gaba ɗaya launi da haske iri ɗaya ne tsakanin idanuwa biyu.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
Matsala mara kyau ita ce lokacin da aka sami tsayin daka, ainihin bambanci a cikin haske da launi tsakanin idanu biyu.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Wannan na iya zama hangen nesa na kusurwoyi da aka kora, duhun facin da ke cikin reflex na ido ɗaya ko idanu biyu, ko jajayen rashi gaba ɗaya.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Gwajin reflex mara kyau na iya nuna kasancewar cataract, retinoblastoma, tabo na corneal, squint, ko kuskuren refractive.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Waɗannan duk suna buƙatar ƙarin kimantawa daga ƙwararrun ƙwararru.
